          "name": "list_pow_coins",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:9605790713904905fe87c7016dfb9df71fc2d9929c8d3c616bec5b210b4d2dc9",
          "description": "Paginated index of the Proof of Work networks BackPow tracks, with algorithm, network rate, collector status and canonical page URL. Optionally filtered by algorithm or restricted to coins currently mining above cost. Returns the distinct algorithm list so valid filter values are discoverable. Use to find which networks exist for an algorithm, to browse the catalogue, or to resolve an ambiguous coin reference. Results are paginated: request a larger limit or a later offset rather than expecting the full catalogue in one response.",
